  },
  "question": {
    "text": "A circular loop of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> is carrying current <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>. The ratio of magnetic field at the centre of circular loop and at a distance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> from the center of the loop on its axis is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The magnitude of magnetic field at the centre of loop is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>1&#160;</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>centre&#160;</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></msub><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0095_e0ec9fba45c9.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 209px;\" /></p><p>The magnitude of magnetic field at a point at a distance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> from the centre along axis of loop is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>axis&#160;</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></msub><mi>i</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>2&#160;</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></msub><mi>i</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mfenced><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mtext>since</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Dividing equation 1 by equation 2, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>"
  }
}